\hich\f2\strike0\ulnone\cf2  , Labour tabled the motion not because it hoped Tory MPs would vote against the government, but because it hoped that would vote for Johnson. It would be useful for Labour to be able to campaign against individual MPs by saying \u8216 X voted to keep Johnson in Downing Street even after he resigned\u8217 .}
